er | TechCorp Solutions | San Francisco, CA | $140k - $180k | Jan 15 | React, TypeScript, CSS, Node.js)\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-16\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"/jobs/job-1 shows title Senior Frontend Developer, TechCorp Solutions, Technology, Full-time, San Francisco CA, $140k-$180k, Posted Jan 15, full description, skills React/TypeScript/CSS/Node.js — matches card\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-17\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Each application record shows name, email, phone (when provided), submission date and message, e.g. \\\"Second Applicant | second.applicant@example.com | 555-987-6543 | Yesterday | Second application message for job 1.\\\"\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-20\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"New jobs and applications show a submission date one day in the past\", \"actual\": \"Browser date is Thu Aug 27 2026. Jobs posted just now display \\\"Posted Yesterday\\\" (card + detail page of job-1787852621201) and applications submitted just now display \\\"Yesterday\\\" in the employer dashboard, instead of \\\"Today\\\"/Aug 27.\", \"evidence\": null}]}"
